PTX CoRR+same-size.cta
"The same with 16-bit stores and loads of one granule (.cta)"
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0   | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0    ;
